So we spent a couple of months
just diving deep into Cyprus.

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:47.020
And then we came here.

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:49.350
I came here with Jack,
my assistant producer,

00:10:49.350 --> 00:10:51.590
and this guy, Corey pop.

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:54.850
I've never traveled with a
real camera person before.

00:10:54.850 --> 00:10:58.880
So to have Corey pop, who is
a DP that worked on explained

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:02.220
and is just incredibly
good at what he does

00:11:02.220 --> 00:11:04.420
to have him with me to help tell this

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:06.830
story was a really special moment.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:09.270
So for the past 10 days,
we've been on the road,

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.080
traversing this entire island,

00:11:11.080 --> 00:11:14.440
talking to military,
going on military vessels,

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:17.420
going into buffer zones,
talking to the UN.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.750
It has been a deep dive
in reporting on Cyprus.

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:23.870
And I am so excited to share
these stories with you.

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:26.893
And while I was here, I
met up with these guys.

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:30.680
I invited Thomas and Nathaniel
to come with me to Cyprus

00:11:30.680 --> 00:11:31.513
because mainly,

00:11:31.513 --> 00:11:33.360
because I just wanted to
hang out with my friends.

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.970
Like these are friends of mine that

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:38.810
I've made on the internet that
I talk to often, but like,

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:40.210
don't get to hang out with very often.

00:11:40.210 --> 00:11:42.990
It's like an overall, it was
just a good time to reflect

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:46.690
and to bond and to have
some like social interaction

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:49.568
for the first time in a really long time.

00:11:49.568 --> 00:11:51.140
- Give this guy a spritz?

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.068
- No.

00:11:52.068 --> 00:11:54.242
(laughs)

00:11:54.242 --> 00:11:56.742
(indistinct)

00:12:01.720 --> 00:12:04.090
- And now they're gone and I am still here

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.490
reporting in Cyprus.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.890
The stories that you're
going to see me tell

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:11.950
in this new series, which is
called by the way, uncharted,

00:12:11.950 --> 00:12:13.910
that's the name of the series.

00:12:13.910 --> 00:12:15.400
The stories you're going to see me tell

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.220
are going to feel like me.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.150
They're going to feel like videos

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.109
I've always made,

00:12:19.109 --> 00:12:22.010
After all, I can't change that.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.680
It's sort of comes from my curiosity,

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.110
that comes from my voice,

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:26.860
but they're going to feel different.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:28.950
They're going to feel more intentional.

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:31.430
They're going to feel more visually rich.

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:33.350
They're going to feel more human.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:36.290
I hope, talk to a lot more
people than I've ever talked to.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:39.030
I was able to focus on the
interviews because I had a camera

00:12:39.030 --> 00:12:40.900
person, you know, Corey
was there shooting.

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:44.010
And so I wasn't there
fiddling with audio and, and,

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:45.000
and getting the frame, right.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:47.370
It was actually like just
focused on the conversations

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.140
and hopefully there'll
be just better reported,

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:52.150
more sensitive, more clear,

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:55.320
more informative than
anything I've ever done.

00:12:55.320 --> 00:12:57.550
I've grown up as a storyteller

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.650
and over the past year and a half.

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:03.730
And I'm really excited to
share this story with you.

00:13:03.730 --> 00:13:06.758
A story that has been on my mind since,

00:13:06.758 --> 00:13:08.920
since I sat in that
classroom in grad school.

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:11.370
And I was like, someday,
I will tell this story.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:14.570
And I've been working
with my composer, Tom Fox,

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:18.750
who has created an entire
custom score for Cyprus.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:22.570
It's like synth and
orchestral and minimal,

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.730
but also like very intense and emotional.

00:13:25.730 --> 00:13:28.180
You're listening to a
little bit of it right now.

00:13:31.404 --> 00:13:34.071
(intense music)

00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:43.524
So I probably shouldn't be
giving away all the juicy stuff

00:13:43.524 --> 00:13:46.560
of this series, but I just can't help it.

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:47.980
There's too much good stuff.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.590
So let me just give you
a little nugget of what

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:52.590
I've been seeing over the past 10 days..

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:55.894
Or the past several decades.

00:13:55.894 --> 00:13:57.833
This has just been no man's land.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.727
(intense music)

00:14:03.008 --> 00:14:05.675
(intense music)

00:14:09.033 --> 00:14:11.340
There was commerce, there was an economy,

00:14:11.340 --> 00:14:12.442
there was trade.

00:14:12.442 --> 00:14:16.410
This place was thriving,
and then it just collapsed

00:14:17.866 --> 00:14:20.533
(intense music)

00:14:22.522 --> 00:14:25.120
(intense music)

00:14:25.120 --> 00:14:27.500
So that's it. That's my update, everyone.

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.570
It feels really good
to be back on the road.

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:30.500
I am exhausted.

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:33.800
My brain is still in this like
middle ground where I'm still

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:37.080
trying to like, make the
stories like come together.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.080
There's still so much reconciling

00:14:39.080 --> 00:14:42.120
I have to do in the
script, but I feel good.

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:45.360
I feel good to be here
back in my natural habitat

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:48.600
on the road, telling
stories, talking to people,

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:51.410
traversing a new place and
trying to understand it and

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:54.900
trying to translate it
to a bigger audience,

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:57.557
so that you can catch a glimpse
of what's happening here

00:14:57.557 --> 00:15:01.500
and the emotions and the people
and the politics at stake.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.800
That is my goal.

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:04.700
That is the update. Thank
you all for being here.

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:09.213
And I will see you very soon
as I kick off uncharted.

00:15:10.173 --> 00:15:12.840
(intense music)

